# Fuel tank: adds fuel storage to its cabled grid ("Fuel tank capacity" tweak). Its fuel lives on
# the structure - destroying it loses the stored fuel. Cone = fuel iconography (fuel nodes are
# cones). Spawned origin 1.4 above ground.
Prefab gameFuelTank
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cone
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.55 0.15
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 2 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
